ementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Boru Tamir Kelepçeleri – Hızlı ve Güvenilir Boru Onarım Çözümü</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-252ef60 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"252ef60\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1d96897 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1d96897\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-17bda6c elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"17bda6c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/product2-boru-tamir-kelepce-300x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-210\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/product2-boru-tamir-kelepce-300x300.jpg 300w, https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/product2-boru-tamir-kelepce-150x150.jpg 150w, https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/product2-boru-tamir-kelepce-100x100.jpg 100w, https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/product2-boru-tamir-kelepce.jpg 500w\" sizes=\"100vw\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-da3473c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"da3473c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Boru tamir kelepçeleri</strong>, borularda oluşan kaçak, çatlak veya delik gibi hasarları <strong>hızlı, pratik ve güvenli şekilde tamir etmek</strong> için kullanılan bağlantı elemanlarıdır. Endüstriyel tesislerden marin hatlara kadar farklı uygulama alanlarında boru sistemlerinin hizmete yeniden alınmasını sağlayarak zaman ve maliyet tasarrufu sunar.</p><p>HD Marine boru tamir kelepçeleri; dayanıklı konstrüksiyon, kaliteli malzeme ve kolay montaj avantajı ile <strong>su, yağ, yakıt ve diğer akışkan hatlarında</strong> etkin çözüm sağlar.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ee37171 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ee37171\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-25b57e9 elementor-view-stacked elementor-position-inline-start elementor-tablet-position-inline-end elementor-shape-circle elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"25b57e9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-table\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M464 32H48C21.49 32 0 53.49 0 80v352c0 26.51 21.49 48 48 48h416c26.51 0 48-21.49 48-48V80c0-26.51-21.49-48-48-48zM224 416H64v-96h160v96zm0-160H64v-96h160v96zm224 160H288v-96h160v96zm0-160H288v-96h160v96z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBoru Tamir Kelepçeleri – Teknik Değerler\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1fe0738 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1fe0738\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table width=\"450\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"189\">Özellik</td><td width=\"261\">Değer</td></tr><tr><td width=\"189\">Ürün Tipi</td><td width=\"261\">Boru Tamir Kelepçesi</td></tr><tr><td width=\"189\">Kullanım Alanı</td><td width=\"261\">Su, yağ, yakıt, kimyasal boru hatları</td></tr><tr><td width=\"189\">Uygulama</td><td width=\"261\">Kaçak ve çatlak tamiri</td></tr><tr><td width=\"189\">Malzeme</td><td width=\"261\">Döküm / Paslanmaz Çelik / Galvanizli Çelik</td></tr><tr><td width=\"189\">Conta Tipi</td><td width=\"261\">EPDM / NBR / Viton</td></tr><tr><td width=\"189\">Uygun Boru Çapı</td><td width=\"261\">1/2” – 20” (15 mm – 500 mm)</td></tr><tr><td width=\"189\">Maks. Basınç</td><td width=\"261\">1 – 28 bar</td></tr><tr><td width=\"189\">Çalışma Sıcaklığı</td><td width=\"261\">-10°C – +300°C</td></tr></tbody></table>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bbeb237 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"bbeb237\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-39cc29c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"39cc29c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6e676e1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6e676e1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-74526f8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"74526f8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Ürün Özellikleri</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6501d6c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6501d6c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>✔ <strong>Hızlı montaj:</strong> Sadece cıvataları sıkmanız yeterli<br />✔ <strong>Çeşitli boru çaplarına uygun:</strong> 15 mm’den 500 mm’ye kadar<br />✔ <strong>Dayanıklı conta:</strong> EPDM / NBR seçenekleri ile geniş akışkan uyumu<br />✔ <strong>Yüksek basınca dayanım:</strong> Endüstriyel hatlara uygun<br />✔ <strong>Korozyona karşı direnç:</strong> Galvanizli veya paslanmaz seçenekler</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ef540a1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ef540a1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-caf8193 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"caf8193\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Kullanım Alanları</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8637f73 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8637f73\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li>Endüstriyel proses boruları</li><li>Denizcilik makine ve hat sistemleri</li><li>Su ve atık su tesisleri</li><li>Yakıt ve yağ transfer hattı</li><li>Kimyasal boru hatları</li></ul><p>Boru tamir kelepçeleri, 